t></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心意<rt>심ˉ이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lông-si-tai-piâu-goà’e sīm-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>春風<rt>춘ˉ헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>微微<rt>삐삐ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>花蕊<rt>훼ˉ뤼ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>送<rt>상ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>芳味<rt>팡ˉ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chūn-hông bi-bī huē-lùi sàng-phāng-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>首<rt>슈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>情歌<rt>졩과ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>送<rt>상ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jît-siû-jieng-koâ goà bêh-sàng-hōr’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>管<rt>관ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>石頭<rt>죻ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>爛<rt>놔ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>海水<rt>해ˆ쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>焦<rt>다ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-koân-jioh-tháu e-noā hâi-jùi e-tâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>深深<rt>침ˉ침ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn ya-yêng-oân-chīm-chīm-ai’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>雖然<rt>쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby>世情<rt>세ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>多<rt>도ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變化<rt>볜ˋ화</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sūi-rien-sè-jiéng tō-pièn-hoa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-